# HR skill stays in sync

You are on HR paths. Product facts an agent cannot infer live in
`.claude/skills/hr-mytrion/SKILL.md` (mirrored to `.cursor/skills/` and `.agents/skills/`).

If this change touches **nav, tab gates, routes, caps, who may write, or which store a write
hits**, update that skill in the **same PR** (all three mirrors). Read the skill before
editing HR UI or APIs.

Do not invent Recruit as this desk. Do not duplicate `zoho-people-api`. The desk is app
Postgres — Zoho People is a one-way admin pull. Do not restyle `MytrionShell` sidebar/header.
